f="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/flydubai-flight-drama-how-indian-pilot-smit-machchhar-stopped-omani-co-pilot-from-crashing-plane/articleshow/134597514.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134597514.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/flydubai-flight-drama-how-indian-pilot-smit-machchhar-stopped-omani-co-pilot-from-crashing-plane/articleshow/134597514.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/flydubai-flight-drama-how-indian-pilot-smit-machchhar-stopped-omani-co-pilot-from-crashing-plane/articleshow/134597514.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T21:11:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134598069,imgsize-66000.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Operation Sheruwali: How security forces tracked LeT commander Musa in months-long hunt since May]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/operation-sheruwali-how-security-forces-tracked-let-commander-musa-in-months-long-hunt-since-may/articleshow/134595813.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134595813.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/operation-sheruwali-how-security-forces-tracked-let-commander-musa-in-months-long-hunt-since-may/articleshow/134595813.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/operation-sheruwali-how-security-forces-tracked-let-commander-musa-in-months-long-hunt-since-may/articleshow/134595813.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T20:42:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134597650,imgsize-99301.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['No ban but also not 24x7': SC on firecrackers in Delhi-NCR ahead of Diwali]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-ban-but-also-not-24x7-sc-on-firecrackers-in-delhi-ncr-ahead-of-diwali/articleshow/134596895.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596895.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Supreme Court has ruled out an outright ban on firecrackers in Delhi-NCR, aiming instead for a compromise between health and cultural practices. Fireworks will only be allowed during specific times, with an emphasis on using environmentally friendly options that satisfy rigorous safety standards by licensed producers. The matter regarding barium in firecrackers will be further examined on October 15.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-ban-but-also-not-24x7-sc-on-firecrackers-in-delhi-ncr-ahead-of-diwali/articleshow/134596895.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-ban-but-also-not-24x7-sc-on-firecrackers-in-delhi-ncr-ahead-of-diwali/articleshow/134596895.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T20:16:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134597261,imgsize-124698.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Dangerous path’: MEA urges Indians to stay away from Russian military recruitment]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dangerous-path-mea-urges-indians-to-stay-away-from-russian-military-recruitment/articleshow/134596800.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596800.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The ministry of external affairs has issued a warning about the risks of joining the Russian armed forces. It stated that many Indians are being recruited under false promises of financial benefits. The advisory emphasized that this path could expose individuals to significant dangers. Continuous engagement with Russia is ongoing to ensure the safety of affected Indian nationals. Citizens are urged to verify job offers and avoid unregistered agents.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dangerous-path-mea-urges-indians-to-stay-away-from-russian-military-recruitment/articleshow/134596800.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dangerous-path-mea-urges-indians-to-stay-away-from-russian-military-recruitment/articleshow/134596800.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T19:49:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134596862,imgsize-123072.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India's monsoon rainfall ends 13% below normal, fourth-lowest since 2001]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-monsoon-rainfall-ends-13-below-normal-fourth-lowest-since-2001/articleshow/134596710.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596710.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[India recorded 87.4 percent of its long period average rainfall during this year's southwest monsoon. The country received 759.4 mm of rain, which is 13 percent below normal. El Niño significantly contributed to the below-average rainfall, especially noted in southern and western regions. Despite a late surge in rainfall, several areas faced substantial deficits, particularly Punjab and South India. The overall monsoon season ended as the driest since 2015.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-monsoon-rainfall-ends-13-below-normal-fourth-lowest-since-2001/articleshow/134596710.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-monsoon-rainfall-ends-13-below-normal-fourth-lowest-since-2001/articleshow/134596710.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T19:43:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134596782,imgsize-55562.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A tap on the table, a pat on the back: The Sonia-Mamata moment that stood out at INDIA bloc meet]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-tap-on-the-table-a-pat-on-the-back-the-sonia-mamata-moment-that-stood-out-at-india-bloc-meet/articleshow/134596071.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596071.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The INDIA bloc meeting focused on alleged electoral irregularities and the opposition’s protest plan, but a warm exchange between Sonia Gandhi and Mamata Banerjee drew attention.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-tap-on-the-table-a-pat-on-the-back-the-sonia-mamata-moment-that-stood-out-at-india-bloc-meet/articleshow/134596071.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-tap-on-the-table-a-pat-on-the-back-the-sonia-mamata-moment-that-stood-out-at-india-bloc-meet/articleshow/134596071.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T19:37:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Mukherjee</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134596442,imgsize-1344980.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Had productive conversation': PM Modi speaks with US President Trump on trade, defence, energy]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://tim